    "group": "Chief Librarian Tigurius",
    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), Tigurius’s unit may make a **psychic roll** if it is free of battle-shock. Roll a D6. A 1 leaves his unit **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**. Choose a **visible** enemy unit no farther than 24″ from it. That enemy takes 2D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**.",
